    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_6874b8feedbda2c74228",
      "document_start": 59,
      "document_end": 68,
      "text": "# 一、系统描述;",
      "section_id": "section_cb533befc8f1"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_129c1b3f3087444d6a89",
      "document_start": 69,
      "document_end": 101,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_cb533befc8f1"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_9fe9170a0dad1e82fea7",
      "document_start": 103,
      "document_end": 180,
      "text": "大多数的工程涉及综合方面，而动态模型在这方面起着重要的作用，可以用动态模型去模拟多方案的系统模型，从中给出最佳的方案组合，节约大量科研和设计的费用和时间。",
      "section_id": "section_cb533befc8f1"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_4f15bb6437df6084cf0d",
      "document_start": 180,
      "document_end": 238,
      "text": "研究系统动力学键合图理论的主要目的是如何更有效地建立系统的模型，并编成相应的计算机软件，利用计算机去预测系统的行为。",
      "section_id": "section_cb533befc8f1"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_ef19a9055c1617a0b281",
      "document_start": 240,
      "document_end": 260,
      "text": "[Source paragraph 2;",
      "section_id": "section_cb533befc8f1"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_76cc5f1a6911587a7499",
      "document_start": 261,
      "document_end": 270,
      "text": "# 二、因果关系;",
      "section_id": "section_cb533befc8f1"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_0289e80196a4980070fc",
      "document_start": 271,
      "document_end": 303,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_cb533befc8f1"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_71883109236774e4fb4f",
      "document_start": 305,
      "document_end": 354,
      "text": "因果关系是键合空间理论和键合图理论中的重要概念，它贯穿键合空间理论的始终，是应用键合图理论的关键。",
      "section_id": "section_cb533befc8f1"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_c36bde140d0b0e507671",
      "document_start": 354,
      "document_end": 419,
      "text": "但时至今日，因果关系的全部意义和指示在很大的程度上仍然还属于一个哲学上争论的话题，我们一般对它的理解是基于生活中的现象，例如我们常",
      "section_id": "section_cb533befc8f1"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_1a410c344a5c52739226",
      "document_start": 421,
      "document_end": 441,
      "text": "[Source paragraph 3;",
      "section_id": "section_cb533befc8f1"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_d5414b82271cafa7aeb7",
      "document_start": 442,
      "document_end": 451,
      "text": "# 二、因果关系;",
      "section_id": "section_cb533befc8f1"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_530508680e23d68717d5",
      "document_start": 452,
      "document_end": 484,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_cb533befc8f1"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_af119e5edcc254306fc7",
      "document_start": 486,
      "document_end": 605,
      "text": "说：阴阳，矛盾的两个方面，主要矛盾的主要方面和次要方面，力和物体的运动，电压和电流的关系等，但是不论系统是如何的繁杂，运动形式的差别如何大，也不论是有形可见的物体还是无形不可见的客观存在的运动，在这所有的背后都可以表现为能量的转换和传递。",
      "section_id": "section_cb533befc8f1"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_821d714d6ea45be5c6ba",
      "document_start": 605,
      "document_end": 655,
      "text": "因此从这种意义上讲，古人云“太极生两仪，两仪生四象，四象生八卦……”这个太极就是能量，两仪即是因果。",
      "section_id": "section_cb533befc8f1"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_4478d2a60525ded73fa6",
      "document_start": 655,
      "document_end": 714,
      "text": "古人说太极阴阳可以成万物，可以表象万物，万物之源也可以追述其中，而键合图理论对不同能量范畴的描述也正好体现了这种思想。",
      "section_id": "section_cb533befc8f1"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_6874fc1d9831a282c03b",
      "document_start": 714,
      "document_end": 797,
      "text": "由于键合图理论因果关系有着极强的灵活性和概括性，也就决定了键合图理论对多样的系统具有极强的表征能力，它对系统的描述在很大的程度上和通常所见的系统建模的方法和思想不同。",
      "section_id": "section_cb533befc8f1"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_da55c0f212ce0566dfd7",
      "document_start": 799,
      "document_end": 819,
      "text": "[Source paragraph 4;",
      "section_id": "section_cb533befc8f1"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_c6016b33b2bc6f78ea0c",
      "document_start": 820,
      "document_end": 829,
      "text": "# 二、因果关系;",
      "section_id": "section_cb533befc8f1"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_14b495d775b4dd8e6ac5",
      "document_start": 830,
      "document_end": 862,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_cb533befc8f1"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_c3291056c9c1dcaf4553",
      "document_start": 864,
      "document_end": 908,
      "text": "直觉的因果律是建立在人们关于物理系统的共同认知的基础上，并且用口头解释的模式来表达出来。",
      "section_id": "section_cb533befc8f1"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_e3c49a46c45fb1e3a1da",
      "document_start": 908,
      "document_end": 961,
      "text": "定量物理学强调了关于起因解释前后关系的因果关联性，这种想法就是用于工程系统设计和诊断的自动系统的基本思想。",
      "section_id": "section_cb533befc8f1"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_68c0cf6b37f8a6c72b4f",
      "document_start": 961,
      "document_end": 984,
      "text": "在键合图的文献中也大量使用了计算因果律的概念。",
      "section_id": "section_cb533befc8f1"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_813be84ffc599b8de9ba",
      "document_start": 984,
      "document_end": 1016,
      "text": "计算因果律指示了模拟中的计算规则，而避免了直觉上的因果律的解释。",
      "section_id": "section_cb533befc8f1"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_9a41cb934c30b7f9ef86",
      "document_start": 1016,
      "document_end": 1050,
      "text": "计算因果律可以看成是总的因果律中的一种，即数量之间是如何相互影响的。",
      "section_id": "section_cb533befc8f1"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_70f615ad2ea3dab45530",
      "document_start": 1050,
      "document_end": 1087,
      "text": "这两种因果律和键合图因果律的关系很密切，在定量物理学因果律和计算因果律中。",
      "section_id": "section_cb533befc8f1"
    }
  ],
